    "title": "Girls Band Cry トゲナシトゲアリ (Album)",
    "description": "Github Link:\n@OriginalCube/Bocchi-Wallpaper\n\n本壁纸基于https://github.com/OriginalCube/Bocchi-Wallpaper 修改而来，请支持原作者OriginalCube\nThis wallpaper is modified based on https://github.com/OriginalCube/Bocchi-Wallpaper. Please support the original author, OriginalCube.\nこの壁紙は https://github.com/OriginalCube/Bocchi-Wallpaper を元に改変されました。オリジナルの作者である OriginalCube をサポートしてください\n이 배경화면은 https://github.com/OriginalCube/Bocchi-Wallpaper 을 기반으로 수정되었습니다. 원래 저자 OriginalCube를 지원해주세요 \n\nLink of the band: https://www.youtube.com/@girlsbandcry\n\nNote: The wallpaper file is large because the music is all flac resources so it has taken up about 550MB\n\n\n\n2024/5/22\nAdded the function of changing image size, but cannot change the height of the spectrum, only allowing the width to adapt:（\n\n添加了更改图片大小的功能，但不能改变频谱的高度,只能让宽度适配  :(\n\n画像のサイズを変更する機能が追加されましたが、スペクトルの高さを変更することはできず、幅を合わせるしかありません:（\n\n그림 크기를 변경하는 기능이 추가되었지만 스펙트럼의 높이는 변경할 수 없으며 폭만 조정할 수 있습니다:(\n\n\n\n2024/5/26\n Add new song ETERNAL FLAME 〜空の箱〜\n\n\n2024/6/9\nAdd the function of customizing background colors, but I am currently unable to use a checkbox to achieve the use of custom background colors or default background colors. Therefore, if you prefer the previous version, please manually roll back :(\n添加了自定义背景颜色的功能，但是我暂时还不能做到通过一个复选框以实现采用自定义背景色或者默认背景色，所以如果更喜欢之前的版本请手动回退 :(\n\n2024/6/10\nImplemented this checkbox function, there may still be bugs, but overall it works\nI may only add new songs in the future, after all, this project was not developed by me. I only made some modifications to it and implemented some custom functions\n花了一晚上实现了复选框功能，可能还存在bug但是大体上可以用了！:)\n后续可能只会添加新曲了，毕竟这个项目本身不是由我开发的，我只是对其进行了部分修改实现了一些自定义功能\n\n2024/6/15 Add new song 空白とカタルシス and Cycle Of Sorrow\n\n2024/6/29 Add new song 運命の華\n\n2024/9/8 Add new songs 闇に溶けてく and 蝶に結いた赤い糸\n\n2025/3/13 Add 8 new songs:\n1.碧いif\n2.無知のち私\n3.渇く、憂う\n4.吹き消した灯火\n5.生きて生きてゆく\n6.臆病な白夜\n7.最期の禱り\n8.ダレモ\n\n2026/6/10 Add  7 new songs\n1.飛べない蝶は夢を見る\n2.薄采ディスプレイ\n3.蜃気楼ニ問フ\n4.命をくれよ\n5.arrow\n6.もう何もいらない未来\n7.荊の薔薇\n\n\nThank you for liking my improvements！",
